Actually wait: another scenario — after game over, app-shell restarts to ready? A5: game over → press R → restart → new game. Contract §3.6: "R 或重开按钮（任意状态）→ 新局" — 新局 = ready state needing start? "重新开始" in §2.6 app orchestration: "state.restart + score.resetCurrent + 重新开始". Ambiguous whether it auto-starts. If it leaves game in 'ready', user must press a direction to start — our awaitingStart reset on R handles it. If app auto-starts, then onStart no-op. Good either way.

